ntent { position: relative; z-index: 1; font-size: 8px; line-height: 1.35; }\n  h1 {\n    text-align:center;\n    font-size:12px;\n    margin:0 0 5px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n  }\n  .intro { margin:0 0 2px; }\n  .section { margin-top:4px; }\n  .table-title { margin: 1px 0 1px; }\n  table { border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; table-layout: fixed; }\n  .function-table { font-size:8px; text-align:center; }\n  .function-table th, .function-table td {\n    border: 1px solid #555;\n    padding: 2px 2px;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    height: 20px;\n  }\n  .function-table th { font-weight: normal; }\n  .function-table .head { height: 26px; }\n  .function-table .rowlabel { width: 42px; }\n  .function-table .wide { line-height: 1.6; }\n  .italic { font-style: italic; }\n  .note-row { height: 28px !important; }\n  .bottom-row { height: 37px !important; }\n  .ovals {\n    height: 29px;\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    gap:2px;\n  }\n  .oval {\n    width: 76px;\n    height: 23px;\n    border: 1px solid #222;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    font-size: 6px;\n    line-height: 1.05;\n    padding: 2px;\n  }\n  .arrow { font-size: 14px; margin: 0 -4px; }\n  .graph-section {\n    margin-top: 4px;\n    position: relative;\n    min-height: 93px;\n  }\n  .graph-label { font-size: 9px; }\n  .graph-title {\n    position:absolute;\n    left: 114px;\n    top: 0;\n    font-size: 9px;\n  }\n  .graph {\n    position:absolute;\n    left:110px;\n    top:14px;\n    width:102px;\n    height:75px;\n  }\n  .axis-x, .axis-y {\n    position:absolute;\n    background:#111;\n    transform-origin:left center;\n  }\n  .axis-x { width:83px; height:1px; left:7px; top:48px; transform:rotate(-22deg); }\n  .axis-y { width:69px; height:1px; left:37px; top:64px; transform:rotate(-108deg); }\n  .line { position:absolute; height:1px; background:#111; transform-origin:left center; }\n  .l1 { width:77px; left:17px; top:65px; transform:rotate(-56deg); }\n  .l2 { width:62px; left:26px; top:62px; transform:rotate(-72deg); }\n  .l3 { width:61px; left:24px; top:62px; transform:rotate(-38deg); }\n  .l4 { width:53px; left:30px; top:59px; transform:rotate(-15deg); }\n  .l5 { width:36px; left:35px; top:56px; transform:rotate(15deg); }\n  .graph small { position:absolute; font-size:6px; white-space:nowrap; }\n  .g1 { left:51px; top:19px; } .g2 { left:69px; top:34px; } .g3 { left:79px; top:44px; }\n  .g4 { left:36px; top:57px; } .g5 { left:14px; top:55px; } .g6 { left:48px; top:66px; }\n  .table33-wrap { margin-left: 114px; width: 157px; }\n  .subhead { font-size:9px; margin:0 0 2px; }\n  .small-table { font-size:7px; text-align:center; }\n  .small-table th, .small-table td {\n    border:1px solid #222;\n    padding:1px;\n    height:16px;\n    vertical-align:middle;\n  }\n  .small-table th { font-weight:normal; }\n  .small-table .side { width:12px; writing-mode:vertical-rl; text-orientation:upright; letter-spacing:0; }\n  .small-table .group { width:20px; }\n  .small-table .long { height:28px; }\n  .small-table .last { height:21px; }\n  .foot { text-align:center; font-size:7px; margin-top:3px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"canvas\">\n  <div class=\"paper\">\n    <div class=\"corner-tr\"></div><div class=\"corner-bl\"></div>\n    <div class=\"wm one\">高考数学</div>\n    <div class=\"wm two\">函数复习</div>\n    <div class=\"diagonal d1\">e随便备课</div>\n    <div class=\"diagonal d2\">@随便备课</div>\n    <main class=\"content\">\n      <h1>三、函数</h1>\n      <p class=\"intro\">1. 概念：A、B为两个非空实数集，对于集合A中任意数x，在集合B中都有唯一确定的数值与之对应，<br>就称f: A→B是A到B的函数。</p>\n      <div class=\"section\">2. 性质：</div>\n      <div class=\"table-title\">定义域</div>\n      <table class=\"function-table\">\n        <tr class=\"head\">\n          <th class=\"rowlabel\">值域</th>\n          <th>一次函数：y=kx+b(k≠0)<br><span class=\"italic\">y∈R</span></th>\n          <th>反比例函数：$y=\\frac{k}{x}$(k≠0)<br><span class=\"italic\">y∈(-∞，0)∪(0，+∞)</span></th>\n          <th>对数函数$x&gt;0$<br>二次函数：$y=ax^2+bx+c,(a≠0)$<br>∵开口方向和对称性</th>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"rowlabel\">单调性</td>\n          <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"wide\">\n            $x_1&lt;x_2,\\ f(x_1)&lt;f(x_2)$ ⟺f(x)是增函数　　$\\frac{f(x_1)-f(x_2)}{x_1-x_2}&gt;0$ ⟺f(x)是增函数<br>\n            $x_1&lt;x_2,\\ f(x_1)&gt;f(x_2)$ ⟺f(x)是减函数　　$\\frac{f(x_1)-f(x_2)}{x_1-x_2}&lt;0$ ⟺f(x)是减函数\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"note-row\">\n          <td class=\"rowlabel\">奇偶性</td>\n          <td colspan=\"3\">①复合函数$y=f（g（x））$　同增异减<br>②$f（-x）=f（x）$（x∈定义域）是偶函数；$f（-x）=-f（x）$是奇函数</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n          <td class=\"rowlabel\">零点</td>\n          <td colspan=\"3\">$f（x）=0$（x∈定义域）是函数图象与x轴交点的横坐标，对称中心$\\left(\\frac{a+b}{2},0\\right)$</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr class=\"bottom-row\">\n          <td></td>\n          <td colspan=\"3\">\n            <div class=\"ovals\">\n              <div class=\"oval\">指数$y=a^x$<br>对数$y=\\log_a x$<br>互为反函数</div>\n              <span class=\"arrow\">→</span>\n              <div class=\"oval\">开口方向a的符号<br>对称轴$x=-\\frac{b}{2a}$</div>\n            </div>\n          </td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n\n      <div class=\"graph-section\">\n        <div class=\"graph-label\">3.　幂函数</div>\n        <div class=\"graph-title\">3.2　五个幂函数的图象</div>\n        <div class=\"graph placeholder\" aria-label=\"[Diagram: five power function graphs]\">\n          <span class=\"axis-x\"></span><span class=\"axis-y\"></span>\n          <span class=\"line l1\"></span><span class=\"line l2\"></span><span class=\"line l3\"></span><span class=\"line l4\"></span><span class=\"line l5\"></span>\n          <small class=\"g1\">$y=x^3$</small><small class=\"g2\">$y=x^2$</small><small class=\"g3\">$y=x$</small>\n          <small class=\"g4\">$y=x^{1/2}$</small><small class=\"g5\">$y=x^{-1}$</small><small class=\"g6\">O</small>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"table33-wrap\">\n        <p class=\"subhead\">3.3　五个幂函数的性质</p>\n        <table class=\"small-table\">\n          <tr>\n            <th class=\"side\"></th>\n            <th class=\"group\">函数</th>\n            <th>$y=x$</th>\n            <th>$y=x^2$</th>\n            <th>$y=x^3$</th>\n            <th>$y=x^{1/2}$</th>\n            <th>$y=x^{-1}$</th>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"side\">定义域</td>\n            <td></td>\n            <td>R</td><td>R</td><td>R</td><td>$[0,+∞)$</td><td>$(-∞,0)∪(0,+∞)$</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"side\">值域</td>\n            <td></td>\n            <td>R</td><td>$[0,+∞)$</td><td>R</td><td>$[0,+∞)$</td><td>$(-∞,0)∪(0,+∞)$</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr>\n            <td class=\"side\">奇偶性</td>\n            <td></td>\n            <td>奇</td><td>偶</td><td>奇</td><td>非奇非偶</td><td>奇</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"long\">\n            <td class=\"side\">单调性</td>\n            <td></td>\n            <td>增</td><td>$(-∞,0)$减<br>$(0,+∞)$增</td><td>增</td><td>增</td><td>$(-∞,0)$减<br>$(0,+∞)$减</td>\n          </tr>\n          <tr class=\"last\">\n            <td class=\"side\">定点</td>\n            <td></td>\n            <td colspan=\"5\">（1,1）</td>\n          </tr>\n        </table>\n        <div class=\"foot\">（1.1）</div>\n      </div>\n    </main>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
